# Forgotten Lore: the opponent chooses distinct cards from the caster's graveyard; paying repeats the choice before the last card returns.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Lotus Petal
Forgotten Lore x2
Forest x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Green)
! Bot1.Hand.Forgotten Lore.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Hand.Forgotten Lore.Cast(Bot2)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}{G}{G}
! Bot2.Choose()
Bot2.Choose(Black Lotus)
Bot1.PayCost
! Bot2.Choose(Black Lotus)
Bot2.Choose(Lotus Petal)
Bot1.Decline
? Bot1.Graveyard = Forgotten Lore; Black Lotus
Bot1.Hand.Forgotten Lore.Cast(Bot2)
Bot2.Choose(Black Lotus)
Bot1.Decline
[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Black Lotus; Forest; Forest; Forest; Lotus Petal
Bot1.Graveyard = Forgotten Lore; Forgotten Lore
